<div class="pz-policy-page page-width" style="max-width: 820px; margin: 3.5rem auto; padding: 0 1.5rem; font-family: 'Barlow', system-ui, sans-serif;">
  <div style="border-bottom: 2px solid #000; padding-bottom: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
    <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 800; color: #ef4444; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;">Replacement &amp; Returns</span>
    <h1 style="font-size: 2.25rem; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0.25rem 0 0;">Refund &amp; Replacement Policy</h1>
  </div>

  <div style="line-height: 1.7; color: #334155; font-size: 0.95rem;">
    <div style="background: #f0fdf4; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
      <strong style="color: #15803d; font-size: 1rem;">100% Free Damage Replacement Guarantee:</strong>
      <p style="margin: 0.25rem 0 0; color: #166534; font-size: 0.9rem;">If your posters or split panels arrive damaged, bent, or misprinted by the courier, we will ship a brand-new set at zero additional cost to you.</p>
    </div>

    <h3 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; color: #000; margin-top: 1.5rem;">1. Reporting Transit Damage</h3>
    <p>To request a free replacement:</p>
    <ol>
      <li>Take a clear photo or short unboxing video showing the damaged prints and outer packaging.</li>
      <li>Email it to <strong>support@posterized.in</strong> along with your Order Number within <strong>48 hours</strong> of receiving the delivery.</li>
      <li>Our support team will verify and dispatch your replacement order within 24 business hours.</li>
    </ol>

    <h3 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; color: #000; margin-top: 1.5rem;">2. Custom Photo Prints</h3>
    <p>Custom photo posters printed from user-uploaded images cannot be refunded for user-provided image quality or resolution flaws. Please ensure you upload high-resolution artwork (1080p or higher recommended).</p>

    <h3 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; color: #000; margin-top: 1.5rem;">3. Cancellations</h3>
    <p>Orders can only be cancelled within <strong>2 hours</strong> of placement before the prints enter our high-speed production line. Once an order is printed and packed, it cannot be recalled.</p>
  </div>
</div>

